  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having selective mute and headphones to quiet people outside of a range is a great addition, but being able to speak to people privately would be a great additional feature.\nI know, I know, go to a private world---but sometimes you want to state something to someone, directly, in a public instance without anyone else being able to hear you.\nBeing able to whitelist a few people who can hear you would be a welcome feature--you could be muted, by default, but people on the list can hear you if you speak.\nThis would allow for private conversations without leaving the server instance.",
